# No `supabase db push`

Never run `supabase db push` (with or without `--linked`, `--include-all`, or other flags).

- Do not push migrations to remote or local databases via the CLI
- Create migration SQL files only; leave applying them to the user
- If a migration needs applying, tell the user to run it themselves
